; Caulder, sketch B "Shock Therapy": F minor, 126 bpm. Rock: a slow dread hook on the overdriven lead over stop-start palm-muted chugs with the flat second, synth bass, a half-time kit and held strings. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song caulder_b
tempo 126
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst lead = A.38 shift=12
inst rgm = B.11 shift=20
inst rg = B.10 shift=20
inst sb = A.52 shift=0
inst str = A.48 shift=0
inst kit = A.120
hit kick=36 rim=37 clap=39 snare=40 hat=44 ohat=46 tom1=45 tom2=48 tom3=50 crash=49

